            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.11.17+HEB.11.18+HEB.11.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Baheb 11:17-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebi obu byahoire, Ruhanga yalenga Abburahamu, yamweta ati: “Abburahamu.” Abburahamu, yayetebuka ati: “Taata.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.3.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Byok 3:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga yamugambira ati: “Twara mutabani wawe, mutabani wawe omu Isaaka ogu ou ogonza, ogende omunsi Moria omuntambire ha rusozi oru ndaakugambira, abe kihongwa ekyokeze.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abburahamu akaimuka nyenkya kara, yatandika enkaina, yatwara babiri ha basaija be abasigazi, na mutabani we Isaaka yayasa enku ez'okwokya ekihongwa, yaimuka, yagenda omu kiikaro Ruhanga eki yamugambiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro ekya kasatu, Abburahamu yaimukya amaiso, yarora ekiikaro eki kiri haraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Abburahamu yagambira abasaija be ati: “Inywe mwikalege hanu n'enkaina, nyowe n'omusigazi onu, katugende nseeri hali turamye, turaagaruka tubasange hanu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abburahamu yakwata enku ez'okwokya ekihongwa, yaitweka Isaaka mutabani we, uwe yakwata omurro n'omuhyo, baagenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaaka yayeta ise yamukaguza ati: “Taata,” Ise yamwetebuka ati: “Ee, kiki mwana wange?” Isaaka yakaguza ise ati: “Omurro n'enku mbinu, baitu entaama ey'ekihongwa eky'okwokya, eri nkaha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abburahamu yagarukamu ati: “Mwana wange, Ruhanga wenka nuwe araayerorra akataama ak'okwokya.” Bombi baayongera orugendo rwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JAS.2.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yak 2:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu baahikire omu kiikaro Ruhanga eki yagambiire Abburahamu, Abburahamu yayombeka itambiro, yahingika enku, yaboha Isaaka omutabani, yamugaramya ha itambiro ha nku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho, Abburahamu yagorra omukono, yakwata omuhyo asale omwana we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika wa MUKAMA yayema omwiguru, yayeta Abburahamu naagamba ati: “Abburahamu, Abburahamu.” Abburahamu yayetebuka ati: “Taata.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otakora kubi omwana wawe, habwokuba hati namanya nkooku otiina Ruhanga, habw'okurora otaanyimire omwana wawe ogu, omu wenka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abburahamu yaimukya amaiso, yamagamaga, kwija kurora enyuma ye, yarora empaya y'entaama, amahembe gaayo gakwatiire omu rusaka, yagenda yagiihayo, niyo yahonga, yaba kihongwa ekyokeze omu kiikaro ky'omwana we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiikaro eki, Abburahamu nikyo yakirukiire ibara “MUKAMA agaba.” Nkooku kyetwa nahati hoona, “Ha rusozi rwa MUKAMA agaba”. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
